  "description": "San Kim, an ordinary comic book maniac. One day, when he was forcibly made to swallow an unknown object by some bullies, he unexpectedly becomes a 'superman' who exerts transcendental powers. But what do you do when you become a ‘superman’? Will you be a 'hero' who has to go through hardships to solve the case? Or a 'villain' who commits all kinds of evil? No matter how you look at it, the ones with a lot of money and charisma are ‘villains’. If so, why should I bother being a hero?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/58149550), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%9E%88%EC%96%B4%EB%A1%9C%EA%B0%80-%EB%90%98%EC%A7%80-%EC%95%8A%EA%B8%B0%EB%A1%9C-%ED%96%88%EB%8B%A4/3979)",
